{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And these are the generations of Esau, the father of Edom</b> — It comes to mention the descendants whom his sons begot after they went with him to Seir, for he himself did not beget there. Now he begins from him, to say that he begot Eliphaz and Reuel, and they begot in the land of Seir these descendants. And he will mention together with them the sons of Oholibamah who were born in the land of Canaan, even though he did not mention for them descendants in the land of Seir, in order that they be counted with their brothers, the sons of Esau mentioned at the beginning of the section, and further because they became chiefs in Seir, for he will mention all their chiefs."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:40:11.347403585Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}